.TH GENBANK 4 2000-1月 "accession_id" "accession_id"
.SH NAME
accession_id \- get current genbank assembly accession id
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIaccession_id(\fBgenbank\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
get current genbank assembly accession id
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgenbank\fB \fR\- 
 a collection of the [File](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.GBFF.File) ncbi genbank assembly 
 object for get its accession id.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a character vector of the ncbi accession id of each genbank assembly;
 
 this function returns a R# error message object if the input genbank 
 data can not be cast to a collection of the [File](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Assembly.NCBI.GenBank.GBFF.File) 
 object.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GenBank
